[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0541","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0541.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1556","title":"Apache HTTP Server 日志文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache Web 服务器在记录客户端请求日志时，未对用户提交的 HTTP 请求中的控制字符进行过滤或转义处理，导致日志文件中包含可直接由客户端注入的原始控制字符。远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP 请求中插入特殊控制字符（如退格符、换行符等），在使用 cat、tail、grep 等 UNIX 标准工具查看日志时隐藏恶意请求记录或伪造源 IP 地址，从而绕过日志审计。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 多个版本，攻击条件低（无需认证），危害表现为日志完整性破坏与审计绕过。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1556"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:30Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.31 及以上版本，或 2.0.49 及以上版本，这些版本已对日志中的控制字符进行转义处理。如无法立即升级，应避免直接使用 cat、tail、grep 等 UNIX 工具查看原始日志，改用支持控制字符过滤的日志分析工具，并在日志查看前通过管道对控制字符进行转义清洗。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-10/0231.html","http://httpd.apache.org/docs/logs.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7363.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1556.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1556","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1556.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1556.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9f54-6r7j-3hph/GHSA-9f54-6r7j-3hph.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1556.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1556.md","https://github.com/privy-cafe/DollarLinuxClub/blob/57ae5d72b23dd6fe9fc5fca4dd120ffdf9dca123/misc/recon.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89762/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0541.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0541.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0489","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1209","title":"Abe Timmerman zml.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"zml.cgi 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 file 参数传递 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 file 参数进行充分的路径过滤与合法性校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、系统密码文件等）。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前已有公开 PoC 代码，利用难度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1209"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:48Z","remediation":"立即停用或删除 zml.cgi 脚本，该脚本已无官方维护且存在目录遍历漏洞。如必须使用 SSI 功能，建议替换为 Apache 原生 mod_include 模块。临时缓解措施：在 zml.cgi 入口处添加参数校验，过滤 `../` 及 `%00` 空字节，并将可访问路径限制在指定白名单目录内。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2001-q4/0086.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2001/Dec/0306.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7751.php","http://www.jero.cc/zml/zml.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3759","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21194","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1209.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1209","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1209.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1209.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wh9g-fhfh-59cq/GHSA-wh9g-fhfh-59cq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/zml_cgi_traversal.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1209.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3759/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1209.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0125","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1562","title":"nvi 格式化字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"nvi（一款 vi 文本编辑器克隆）1.79 之前版本中存在格式化字符串漏洞。当用户使用 nvi 打开或处理包含格式化字符串占位符（如 %s、%n 等）的特制文件名时，程序未对文件名中的格式化字符串进行正确过滤，导致攻击者可利用该漏洞以当前用户权限执行任意代码。本地攻击者只需构造一个包含恶意格式化字符串的文件名并诱使目标用户（或通过自动化脚本）使用 nvi 打开该文件，即可触发漏洞，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 nvi 1.79 之前的所有版本，CVSS v2.0 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1562"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:30Z","remediation":"升级 nvi 至 1.79 或更高版本以修复格式化字符串漏洞。如无法升级，可限制受影响用户对 nvi 的执行权限，或移除 nvi 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100526142205694&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-085","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7317.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3456","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1562.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1562","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1562.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1562.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7jv7-g8h7-56pp/GHSA-7jv7-g8h7-56pp.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-085.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1562.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d7ea6f4b-2028-475d-b894-118b544addca.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0123","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1534","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_usertrack 可预测 Session ID 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.11 至 1.3.20 版本的 mod_usertrack 模块在生成会话 ID 时使用了可预测的信息，包括主机 IP 地址、系统时间和服务器进程 ID。本地攻击者通过观察或获取这些可预测因素，能够推算出其他用户（如管理员）的会话 ID，从而在未授权的情况下劫持会话并绕过身份认证机制。该漏洞影响范围有限，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1534"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:27Z","remediation":"Apache 1.3.x 已于 2010 年停止维护，官方不再发布安全更新。建议立即升级至 Apache 2.4.x 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在 httpd.conf 中注释或删除 `LoadModule usertrack_module` 行以禁用 mod_usertrack 模块，改用基于数据库或 Redis 的会话管理方案。若必须使用 mod_usertrack，设置 `CookieStyle Cookie` 并配合 `CookieTracking on` 限制其使用范围，同时确保服务器通过 NTP 同步时间并避免在公网暴露会话 ID。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2001/11/msg00084.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7494.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3521","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1534.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1534","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1534.md","https://github.com/OWASP/pytm/blob/86ccaa8601f19af69ed87fe0c171e520e3f30cf4/docs/threats.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1534.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/low/Apache%20mod_usertrack%E5%8F%AF%E9%A2%84%E8%A8%80ID%E4%BA%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-1534).html","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1534.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1534.md","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/capec/2.0/attack-pattern/attack-pattern--7ee89c1f-50a5-42e6-abdb-6d8ba0349810.json","https://github.com/sdnewhop/grinder/blob/7432531e4a5a4ce3cc8224ac852188ef1d18432d/samples/062019-f5-bigip-hashes/json/vulnerability.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0123.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0121","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1507","title":"OpenSSH Kerberos V 认证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 3.0.1 之前版本在启用 Kerberos V 认证时存在身份验证绕过漏洞。由于 Kerberos V 认证模块未能正确验证用户身份，远程攻击者无需有效凭据即可绕过认证机制，直接以任意用户身份登录目标系统，获取未授权访问权限。攻击者只需向目标 SSH 服务发起连接请求即可触发该漏洞，无需特殊权限或复杂前置条件。该漏洞影响所有启用 Kerberos V 认证的 OpenSSH 3.0.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 OpenSSH 3.0.1 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1507"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:24Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenSSH 3.0.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Kerberos V 认证绕过问题。如无法立即升级，在 sshd_config 中设置 `KerberosAuthentication no` 禁用 Kerberos 认证作为临时缓解措施，并限制 SSH 服务仅对可信 IP 开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://msgs.securepoint.com/cgi-bin/get/bugtraq0111/114.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7598.php","http://www.openbsd.org/errata30.html#sshd","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3560","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1507.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1507","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1507.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1507.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mg6j-7hwf-j46v/GHSA-mg6j-7hwf-j46v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1507.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2001/CVE-2001-1507","https://github.com/threatworx/twigs/blob/b2648a584b661b338aa18dfdbfd4ff236fd07773/twigs/ssh-audit.py","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_301.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1507.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0120","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1505","title":"tinc VPN 重放攻击漏洞","description":"tinc 1.0pre3 及 1.0pre4 版本存在重放攻击漏洞。远程攻击者可通过嗅探网络流量并重放捕获的数据包，向用户会话中注入恶意数据，导致会话劫持或数据篡改。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者仅需具备网络监听能力即可实施攻击，无需认证。此漏洞影响 tinc VPN 早期预览版本，建议升级至更新版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1505"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:23Z","remediation":"升级到 tinc 1.0pre5 或更高版本，该版本修复了数据包重放攻击问题。建议直接升级到最新的 tinc 1.1 稳定版，该版本使用全新协议并修复了所有已知安全弱点。如无法升级，可在 tinc 配置中启用 MACLength 选项并设置为完整 HMAC 长度以增强数据包认证强度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/249142","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3837","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7870","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1505.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1505","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1505.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1505.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2jvh-95r9-r8rh/GHSA-2jvh-95r9-r8rh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1505.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--49e592da-e9cf-4e90-aaf7-f7201aad49b2.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2001/CVE-2001-1505","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0119","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1494","title":"util-linux script 命令本地任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"util-linux 软件包 2.11n 版本之前的 script 命令存在符号链接跟随漏洞（CWE-59）。本地攻击者可通过将 typescript 会话日志文件硬链接指向系统任意关键文件，诱导 root 用户执行 script 命令记录终端会话，导致脚本以 root 权限覆盖目标文件内容，实现任意文件覆盖写入。该漏洞影响 util-linux 2.11n 之前所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 5.5 (MEDIUM)，攻击向量为本地 (AV:L)，攻击复杂度低 (AC:L)，需要低权限 (PR:L)，无需用户交互 (UI:N)，主要影响完整性 (I:H)，机密性和可用性无影响。攻击者需具备本地账户权限并能诱导管理员执行 script 命令，利用方式为创建恶意硬链接指向敏感系统文件（如 /etc/passwd、/etc/shadow 或关键配置文件），待 root 执行 script 记录会话时覆盖目标文件导致权限提升或系统破坏。Red Hat 等发行版已在 util-linux 2.11n 及后续版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1494"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:22Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 util-linux 至 2.11n 或更高版本（如 util-linux 2.11n、2.12 及以上版本），通过包管理器执行升级：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install util-linux`，RHEL/CentOS 执行 `yum update util-linux`。若暂无法升级，可通过限制普通用户执行 script 命令权限（`chmod 750 /usr/bin/script`）或配置 auditd 审计 script 调用作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","