verity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1352"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:06Z","remediation":"升级 Namazu 至 2.0.10 或更高版本（2.0.9 及更早版本存在此漏洞）。Red Hat Linux 用户可安装 RHSA-2001:162-04 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器前端部署 WAF 规则过滤 idxname 参数中的恶意 HTML/JavaScript 字符作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100947261916155&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101060476404565&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101068116016472&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/5691","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7875","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1352.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1352","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1352.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1352.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6vp8-72hx-47vm/GHSA-6vp8-72hx-47vm.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1352.md","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2001-1352/2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1352.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_xss.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/14bb986e846fe12089d9a0db6d36001bfb343b78/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0416.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0414","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0414.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1351","title":"Namazu 2.0.8 跨站脚本攻击","description":"Namazu 2.0.8及更早版本的索引文件命中数显示功能存在跨站脚本漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的索引文件名，在显示命中数时注入任意JavaScript代码，导致其他Web用户浏览时执行恶意脚本。该漏洞影响Namazu 2.0.8及更早版本，CVSS评分7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者无需认证即可通过构造恶意索引文件名诱导用户访问，触发跨站脚本攻击，窃取用户会话、窃取敏感信息或执行其他恶意操作。建议升级至Namazu 2.0.9及以上版本修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1351"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Namazu 2.0.9 或更高版本（当前最新稳定版为 2.0.21），可从 http://www.namazu.org/stable/ 下载源码重新编译安装。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面对搜索结果页的索引文件名输出进行 HTML 实体编码，防止 index 文件名称中的 JavaScript 代码在浏览器中执行，或在防火墙/反向代理层对包含 script、onerror 等关键字的搜索请求参数进行过滤拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&w=2&r=1&s=namazu&q=b","http://www.osvdb.org/5690","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7875","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3619c6454232bc86bc1c5ee6d49baecbff394f3b/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1351.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1351","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/581b673c344d829d047fea0ed051c916f949df9f/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1351.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f8615defb985bab445eb5487b411802098cc3657/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1351.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x5rv-2px2-rwjj/GHSA-x5rv-2px2-rwjj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1351.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--889deca9-0235-4157-ae7e-79ad83ffdd4d.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_xss.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1351.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0414.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0338","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0338.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0886","title":"GNU glibc glob 函数缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"glibc 的 glob 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造以左大括号 \"{\" 结尾的 glob 模式字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务（程序崩溃）并可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 glibc 的 Linux 发行版，包括 Debian Linux、Mandrake Linux、Red Hat Linux 等主流发行版。攻击条件为本地访问权限、低攻击复杂度、无需身份认证，攻击者可通过构造恶意 glob 模式触发漏洞，导致程序崩溃或在特定条件下实现任意代码执行，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地/低复杂度/无需认证/部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响）。Debian 已发布 DSA-103 安全公告修复该漏洞，Mandrake 发布 MDKSA-2001-095 补丁，Red Hat 亦发布相应安全更新。GitHub 等代码托管平台已收录相关 PoC 代码及 Nuclei 检测模板。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0886"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 到包含修复的版本（如 glibc 2.2.4+，该版本修复了 2001 年 CVE-2001-0886 中的 glob 函数缓冲区溢漏洞）。如果使用较旧的系统(如 Red Hat Linux 7.0、Mandrake 8.x)，请立即应用相应的安全补丁。当前大多数现代 Linux 发行版（Debian 11+、Ubuntu 18.04+、CentOS 8+）均已包含修复。已修复且认可的系统无需额外缓解措施，但残留的系统应保持锁定的权限并限制网络访问 glob 函数的可执行程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000447","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-037-01","http://sources.redhat.com/ml/bug-glibc/2001-11/msg00109.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-029.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-103","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-095.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1752.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-160.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245956","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3707","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBTL0112-008","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7705","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0886.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0886.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0886","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0886.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-29c9-5v6h-437j/GHSA-29c9-5v6h-437j.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-095.nasl","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0886.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-103.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0338.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0335","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0335.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0884","title":"GNU Mailman 邮件列表管理器 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Mailman 电子邮件归档系统 2.08 之前版本存在跨站脚本漏洞，攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的邮件链接，诱导其他用户点击访问归档页面时触发脚本执行，窃取受害者的会话凭证、浏览器 Cookie 等敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Mailman 2.08 之前所有版本，攻击者需诱导受害者点击恶意链接并访问邮件归档页面，利用方式为构造包含恶意 JavaScript 的邮件内容，当受害者浏览归档页面时脚本在浏览器执行导致信息泄露。CVSS 5.1 分，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度高，需用户交互，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0884"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Mailman 2.1.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了跨站脚本漏洞。浏览器禁用JavaScript执行某些邮件列表操作以降低风险。此外，确保邮件列表仅向授权用户发布，并配置正确的认证机制以防止信息泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-168.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-169.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-170.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3721","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/242839","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3602","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7617","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0884.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0884","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0884.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0884.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-298p-q946-hhq4/GHSA-298p-q946-hhq4.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0884.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0884.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c68c027a-9beb-4817-8136-840f0f2b691d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0335.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0333","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0873","title":"Taylor UUCP 1.0.6 - Argument Handling Privilege Escalation 漏洞","description":"Taylor UUCP 1.06 版本的 uuxqt 组件未能正确过滤和移除危险的长选项参数，允许本地用户通过调用 uux 并使用 --config 选项指定备用配置文件来提升权限。该漏洞为本地权限提升漏洞，攻击者需先在目标系统上拥有本地账户权限，利用 uux 命令的参数处理缺陷，可绕过权限检查获取更高权限，进而在系统上执行任意操作。CVSS 评分为 7.2，属于高危级别。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0873"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08Z","remediation":"升级 Taylor UUCP 至 1.07 或更高版本以修复参数处理缺陷。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-079 安全通告更新 uucp 包，Red Hat 用户应应用 RHSA-2001:165 通告中的补丁，Caldera 用户参考 CSSA-2001-033.0，SuSE 用户参考 SuSE-SA:2001:38。临时缓解措施：移除 uuxqt 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/uuxqt），并限制本地用户对 uux 命令的调用权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000425","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100715446131820","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-165.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-033.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-079","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_038_uucp_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/212892","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3312","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7099","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21106","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/91b7f8a86c778da65a1fe33c64b708fe3875c0e3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0873.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0873","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d0559163b1a8bfdd19709ab97d90eb1d679f1671/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0873.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dfa0c652458f6076ec06eb7e370bd1f48212ff84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0873.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8cx5-vc2r-w88x/GHSA-8cx5-vc2r-w88x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-079.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0873.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-079.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0333.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0333.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0331","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0331.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0872","title":"OpenSSH OpenSSH UseLogin环境变量传递漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 3.0.1 及更早版本在启用 UseLogin 选项时，未对关键环境变量（如 LD_PRELOAD）进行有效过滤和清理。攻击者可在已登录目标系统的条件下，通过设置 LD_PRELOAD 等环境变量加载恶意共享库，在 SSH 会话切换过程中获取 root 级执行权限。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 早期版本中启用了 UseLogin 功能的 Linux/Unix 系统，利用条件要求攻击者已具有本地用户访问权限，最终可导致本地权限提升并完全控制目标主机。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0872"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.0.2 或更高版本（如 OpenSSH 3.0.2p1 及以上），或在 sshd_config 中将 UseLogin 设置为 no 并重启 sshd 服务禁用 UseLogin 功能；同时建议在 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 中设置 PermitUserEnvironment no 并重启 sshd 服务以禁止用户自定义环境变量，彻底阻断 LD_PRELOAD 等环境变量注入提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000446","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2001:092","http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2001-Dec/0001.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100749779131514&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=openssh-unix-dev&m=100747128105913&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-026.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-091","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/157447","http://www.osvdb.org/688","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-161.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3614","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0112-005","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7647","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0872.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0872","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0872.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0872.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-65cx-7mf4-2jgg/GHSA-65cx-7mf4-2jgg.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a0